.TH tkustrings n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkustrings \- printable strings viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkustrings
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkustrings::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on the tclutils strings engine (tustrings). Lists the printable
ASCII runs found in binary data. See docs/tkustrings.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, strings, binary
